IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0047.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0047C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 PEN-WAIVE-FLG      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "PEN-WAIVE-FLG=" PEN-WAIVE-FLG
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF FIRST-OFFENSE = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN LOYALTY-TIER = 'G' OR 'P'
                MOVE 'Y' TO PEN-WAIVE-FLG
                MOVE 0 TO PENALTY-AMT
            WHEN DAYS-PAST-DUE <= 7
                MOVE 'Y' TO PEN-WAIVE-FLG
                MOVE 0.00 TO PENALTY-AMT
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
